{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"dc63c62d8a005cac","type":"text","text":"\n## **09:45** - Right word, wrong task\n## **09:55** -\tT.A.S.K  GAME \n## **10:10** - *Exercises 10 t/m 13*\n\n## **10:20** -\tWrap-up and homework reminder","x":-324,"y":-165,"width":649,"height":212,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ba7f2a48a28ba420","type":"text","text":"***Homework***\n- Finish any incomplete **B Theme Words exercises 10-13** and practise the *At the doctor's* vocabulary.\n- For **three** homework questions, mark **T/A/S** before answering and tick **K** after checking.","x":-324,"y":70,"width":449,"height":172,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d29f691e9069fed0","type":"text","text":"# **Today's Class: vocabulary and question-decoding**","x":-344,"y":-241,"width":828,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b8030f925c2e2044","type":"text","text":"*Choose the correct word*; \n*Write TWO words*; \n*Write the word that does NOT fit*. \n\n\n what would a successful answer look like **without answering**.","x":678,"y":98,"width":432,"height":198,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"2bf8cf5dedd2dd8f","type":"text","text":"**Before I answer a question:**\n\n- **T | Task word:** Circle what I must do: *translate, choose, complete, correct, write*.\n- **A | Answer form:** Box the language or form: *English, Dutch, one word, a choice, a sentence*.\n- **S | Special conditions:** Underline anything extra: *TWO, NOT, past simple, only*.\n- **K | Keep checking:** Reread the question. Does my answer do **exactly** what it asks?\n\n**Rule for today's games:** Do not write an answer until you can finish this sentence: **“I must __________, and my answer must be __________.”**","x":530,"y":414,"width":728,"height":388,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a7a0aba4097cbae7","type":"text","text":"## Round 1: Instruction sort (pairs)\n\n**First sort each card by its task word: TRANSLATE, CHOOSE, COMPLETE or CORRECT. Then mark T/A/S. Only then solve it.**\n\n| Card | Question | Task type | My answer |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **1** | **Translate** *huisarts* **into English**. | __________ | __________ |\n| **2** | **Choose** the correct English word for *gips*: A **plaster** / B **cast** / C **crutches**. | __________ | __________ |\n| **3** | **Complete** the sentence with **one Theme Word**: “I made an __________ with the GP.” | __________ | __________ |\n| **4** | **Correct** the English word so the translation is right: *tandarts = surgeon*. | __________ | __________ |\n\n**Pair check:** Before revealing answers, tell your partner how the instruction told you to respond.","x":1454,"y":414,"width":709,"height":475,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b124d8979e2c3371","type":"text","text":"## Round 2: Decode, Do, Check (groups of three)\n\n**Roles:**\n\n1. **Decoder** circles / boxes / underlines the important instructions and says what to do.\n2. **Solver** answers using the Theme Words B list if needed.\n3. **Checker** reads the instruction again and says whether the response **fits the task**.\n\n**Rotate roles after every two cards.** The vocabulary page may be open for cards 5-7; try cards 8-10 without looking at it first.\n\n| Card | Question | What matters in the instruction? | My answer |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **5** | **Write TWO English words** for people who work in healthcare, from *At the doctor's*. | __________________ | 1. __________  2. __________ |\n| **6** | **Translate** *waiting room* **into Dutch**. | __________________ | __________ |\n| **7** | **Choose the word that does NOT belong** with medical staff: *dentist / surgeon / prescription*. | __________________ | __________ |\n| **8** | **Complete** the sentence using **one word** from Theme Words B: “The doctor took an __________ of my broken arm.” | __________________ | __________ |\n| **9** | **Write the English translation** of *pleister*. | __________________ | __________ |\n| **10** | **Complete** the sentence using the **past simple of go**: “Yesterday I __________ to the GP.” **Reminder from Chapter 1, not new grammar.** | __________________ | __________ |\n\n**Group discussion after card 10:** Which mistake was hardest to avoid?\n\n- [ ] I almost answered in the wrong language.\n- [ ] I missed a word like **TWO** or **NOT**.\n- [ ] I knew the word but misunderstood **what type of answer** was needed.\n- [ ] I understood the task but did not know the vocabulary or grammar.","x":1454,"y":-467,"width":1054,"height":817,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"08a135750dedc87b","type":"text","text":"## Round 3: Stepping Stones, exercises 10-13\n\nFor each **real exercise instruction**:\n\n1. **Circle** the command word.\n2. **Box** the language or answer form.\n3. **Underline** numbers, *not*, or other special conditions.\n4. Explain to your partner: **“I must __________.”**\n5. **Only then** complete the exercise. Check the instruction again at the end.\n\n| Exercise | Task word  | Answer form/direction | Special condition | Checked? |\n| -------- | ---------- | --------------------- | ----------------- | -------- |\n| **10**   | __________ | __________            | __________        | [ ]      |\n| **11**   | __________ | __________            | __________        | [ ]      |\n| **12**   | __________ | __________            | __________        | [ ]      |\n| **13**   | __________ | __________            | __________        | [ ]      |\n\n*Do not guess the instructions from this sheet. Use the exact words in your coursebook or digital assignment.*","x":2631,"y":350,"width":907,"height":498,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"5f7417637a088913","type":"text","text":"## Exit ticket (independent, 3 minutes)\n\n**A. Mark T/A/S on this instruction, then answer it:**\n\n**Translate** *afspraak* **into English**. Write **one word**.\n\n**Task word:** __________________  **Answer form:** __________________  **Special condition:** __________________\n\n**Answer:** __________________________\n\n**B. Mark T/A/S and answer:**\n\n**Choose** the word that does **NOT** describe a medical professional: **dentist / GP / prescription**.\n\n**Task word:** __________________  **Answer form:** __________________  **Special condition:** __________________\n\n**Answer:** __________________________\n\n**One thing I will do before answering a question on the next test:**\n\n____________________________________________________________________","x":-410,"y":414,"width":498,"height":526,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"eb8945126d2f9618","type":"text","text":"**“Translate wachtkamer into English.”** \n\nStudent A answers *wachtkamer*; \nStudent B answers *waiting room*.\n\n“Why would one lose a mark even if they recognise the word?”","x":678,"y":-241,"width":432,"height":270,"color":"3"}
	],
